# Normalise line endings on commit, check out per-platform. The working copy is
# CRLF on Windows; git stores LF so a diff never shows a whole file as changed.
* text=auto

# The app's own source: keep it text so git never treats it as binary.
*.js   text
*.css  text
*.html text
*.md   text
*.json text

# Nothing binary is tracked, but be explicit rather than rely on sniffing.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff binary